<p>Welcome to my browser hacking project! This page lets you explore different browser objects and see what information they contain.</p>

<p>Use the buttons below to check out different objects. The results will appear in the large text box. You can also sort the results alphabetically.</p>

<p>Different browsers may show different results. This is a way to learn how browsers work and how JavaScript can access their information.</p>

